  <IMP_AutomationOffTitle>Automation is switched off</IMP_AutomationOffTitle>
  <IMP_AutomationOffBody>{0} spreads this colony across several levels. Implanner cannot carry an implant or an operation across a level boundary, so rather than deliver half of every plan it hands the work back to you: no item reservations and no surgery scheduling.\n\nEverything else still works. Keep building plans, assign them, rank your implants — add operations yourself, and Implanner will track what has been delivered and what is still missing.</IMP_AutomationOffBody>

